  "description": "👑 <strong>Great British Summer Savings applied to dates up until September 1st!</strong> Ticket prices include the temporary VAT reduction, with the full saving passed on to you.<br><br> ⭐ <em>Experience Boom Lab — London’s ultimate group gaming adventure! Jump across platforms, dodge lasers, smash glowing targets, and tackle fast-paced challenges with your team in six immersive rooms. Test your reflexes, brainpower, and teamwork in this real-life video game experience. Perfect for friends, families, team-building events, and unforgettable birthday parties. Are you ready to play?</em><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🕛 75 minutes, 6 adrenaline-pumping challenges, endless fun<br> 🎯 Dodge lasers, solve puzzles, aim at targets, leap over lava, and more<br> 🎨 Grand Finale: End with a massive, colour-exploding blast!<br> 👥 Perfect for groups of 2 to 16 people. Groups of 9-16 people will be split into two teams. For larger groups, contact us <a href=\"https://boomlabexperience.com/london/#groups\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a> for more information<br> 🤩 Ideal for birthday celebrations, bachelor(ette) parties and team building!<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br> ⏳ Duration: approx. 75 minutes<br> 📍 Venue: Arches 4&amp;5, 83 Rivington Street, EC2A3AY. There is no parking available, we recommend using local public transport.<br> 👤 Age requirement: 12 years old. Under 15's require an accompanying adult.<br> ✅ Anyone attending the experience must sign the <a href=\"https://app.waiverforever.com/pending/E7vuCq5pw41766490364\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Safety Pledge and Liability Waiver</strong></a> - this can be completed before arrival.<br> 🎟️One ticket per person. Please ensure the ticket quantity matches your group size at checkout.<br> ♿ Accessibility: the venue is accessible; however, some rooms will be less suited to customers with physical access requirements. For more information, please refer to the FAQs.<br> ❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://boomlabexperience.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> 🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for Boom Lab&nbsp;<a href=\"https://feverup.com/m/63081\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br> ❗We suggest <strong>wearing something you don't mind getting a little paint on</strong><br><br><strong>Game Zones</strong><br> 🔵 Blue Blur: A multi-screen system where players will cooperate by sharing complex information through the screens. Communication is the key.<br> 💡 Pink Panic: A high-tech twist on Whack-a-Mole with lights, sound, and multiple game modes to push your reflexes to the limit<br> 🔴 Red Reflex: Navigate a laser-filled maze without getting caught—stealth, speed, and precision are key<br> 💛 Yellow Yell: Solve puzzles and launch objects at six targets with the possible solutions—how good is your aim?<br> 🔥 Orange Outrun: Dodge fireballs, leap across platforms, and collect keys in a team game where The Floor is Lava—literally<br> 💥 Solara: The grand finale. One last mission. One massive paint blast. Will you light up the world—or vanish into the void?<br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> Boom Lab London is a high-energy group gaming experience where every second counts. Across six immersive rooms, you’ll jump, dodge, and strategize through fast-paced team challenges. With neon lights, high-tech effects, and an atmosphere straight out of a video game, it’s an adventure like no other. Rally your team, take on the action, and build up to an epic, colour-blasting finale! Get your tickets now for Boom Lab London!<br><br><strong>Contact Number: </strong>07988105579<br>",
